From: Miguel <kuboloko.info@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:48:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] content(cotl): finalise written copy for the fan
 subsection

Replaces the placeholder prose with final story copy. Image paths and
the .cotl styling are untouched.

- characters.ts: full 3-4 sentence bios for Palin Majere, Karst Uth
  Matar, Gryff, Ariakan Ariakas, and Lord Soth (accurate Knight of the
  Black Rose lore); a deliberately vague 2-3 sentence bio for Zorath
- site.ts: legal disclaimer switched to the site's Portuguese wording;
  hero hook trimmed to two sentences
- historia.tsx: backstory (gods' return, the Dragonarmy war, Takhisis
  cast into the Abyss) then the present-day premise; Krynn / Ansalon /
  Dragonlance named explicitly
- conflito.tsx: the search for the Silver Child, the Eight Knights, a
  "Children versus Legacy" theme section, and the four key locations
  noted as changed since the original Chronicles trilogy
- creditos.tsx: standing note that official artwork is credited beside
  each image
- personagens.tsx: reader-facing intro line instead of the editor note

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
